# The initialised conjunct of Armed dropped: an absent marker, deleted by the
# purge, does not hold L, so the re-created incarnation arms while a straddler of
# the purged incarnation is still being allocated. The design kept this guard as a
# redundancy check (clean in its LegacyHandOff configuration); with the purge
# in the environment it is load-bearing here. It edits the Armed predicate, so it
# names no perturbed action.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestNoMarkerInit
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the activation arms while L's marker state is not initialised
BOUNDS: WithRecreate = TRUE, WithUnclaimedSurvivor = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ claimed[a]
    /\ mInit

--- REPLACE
    /\ claimed[a]
\* MUTATION: an uninitialised marker does not hold the advance.

--- END
